"use strict";(self.webpackChunkrestaurant_page=self.webpackChunkrestaurant_page||[]).push([[962],{477:(e,t,o)=>{o.d(t,{D:()=>r});let r=document.createElement("div");r.setAttribute("id","home"),r.classList.add("tabcontent"),r.innerText="Welcome to Purr & Perk Cat Cafe, where the soothing aroma of freshly brewed coffee mingles with the playful purrs of our feline friends. Nestled in the heart of the city, our cozy cafe offers a unique experience where cat lovers can sip on delicious coffee creations while enjoying the company of adorable adoptable cats.\n\nAt Purr & Perk, we believe in creating a haven for both humans and cats alike. Our space is designed to provide a tranquil atmosphere where guests can unwind, work, or simply revel in the joy of feline companionship. Whether you're seeking a moment of relaxation or a furry friend to brighten your day, our cafe is the perfect destination.\n\nOur menu features a variety of specialty coffees, teas, and delectable treats to satisfy your cravings. From creamy lattes to rich espresso shots, there's something for every coffee connoisseur to enjoy. And for those with a sweet tooth, our selection of pastries and desserts is sure to delight.\nBut the true stars of our cafe are our resident cats. Handpicked from local shelters, each of our feline friends is lovingly cared for and eagerly awaits their forever home. Whether you're looking to adopt or simply spend time with these charming creatures, our cat lounge offers the perfect opportunity to connect with them on a personal level.\n\nAt Purr & Perk Cat Cafe, we're more than just a coffee shop—we're a community dedicated to spreading love, joy, and compassion to both humans and animals alike. So come join us for a cup of coffee and a cuddle with our adorable cats. We can't wait to welcome you with open paws!"}},e=>{e(e.s=477)}]);